an exact line fits its rate and intercept: true
points without operations are not fitted: true
a time that does not grow with the operations fits nothing: true
one operation count fits nothing: true
on CUDA/HIP every swept extent is timed, seeded as one scalar kernel's contraction: true
on CUDA/HIP the kernel's operations grow with the reduction extent: true
where the seeded default does not apply, the sweep refuses rather than time the default: true
